Third-party notices
====================

VEIL uses the two datasets below as local files. A maintainer downloads them
with veil-browser/tools/fetch_geo.py, which checks the official .sha256sum
before writing veil-browser/data/geo/cache/. The binaries are gitignored and
are not part of this source tree.

They are used only for offline annotation, or to block ad and tracker
domains when the user turns that setting on. The setting is off by default.
They are not used to choose a route, to open a connection, or to resolve a
name. Do not substitute Loyalsoldier or sing-box builds. Those are GPL-3 and
are not approved for this tree.

